A_272 - It is clear that the phenomena of &ldquo;peoplefield&rdquo; and &ldquo;gaslighting&rdquo; can also occur simultaneously and that the presence of these combined phenomena creates very particular situations. However, you can escape from &ldquo;peoplefield&rdquo; by going elsewhere physically (for example by going trekking) while from &ldquo;gaslighting&rdquo; it is difficult to escape as at the moment there are no mechanisms to block all online elements closely linked to the person who suffers &ldquo;gaslighting&rdquo;.